 'UNF', 'UNH', 'USG', 'UST', 'V10', 'V11', 'V14', 'VMA', 'VOW', 'WAR', 'WC00', 'WC01', 'WC02', 'WC03', 'WC04', 'WC97', 'WC98', 'WC99', 'WHO', 'WOC', 'WOE', 'WOT', 'XANA', 'XLN', 'ZEN', 'ZNR']
original_text: ['All creatures have "At the beginning of your upkeep, sacrifice this creature unless you pay {1}."', 'All creatures have haste.', 'All lands are 1/1 creatures that are still lands.', "Amrou Kithkin can't be blocked by creatures with power 3 or greater.", "As Black Vise enters the battlefield, choose an opponent.\\nAt the beginning of the chosen player's upkeep, Black Vise deals X damage to that player, where X is the number of cards in his or her hand minus 4.", "As Call to Arms enters the battlefield, choose a color and an opponent.\\nWhite creatures get +1/+1.\\nWhen the chosen color isn't the most common color among permanents the chosen player controls, sacrifice Call to Arms.", 'As Sol Grail enters the battlefield, choose a color.\\n{T}: Add one mana of the chosen color to your mana pool.', 'At end of combat, gain control of all creatures blocking The Wretched as long as you control The Wretched.', "At the beginning of each player's upkeep, Storm World deals X damage to that player, where X is 4 minus the number of cards in his or her hand.", "At the beginning of each player's upkeep, destroy target nonartifact creature that player controls of his or her choice. It can't be regenerated.", "At the beginning of your upkeep, Halfdane's power and toughness become equal to the power and toughness of target creature other than Halfdane, until the end of your next upkeep.", 'At the beginning of your upkeep, choose flying, first strike, trample, or rampage 3. Gabriel Angelfire gains that ability until your next upkeep.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, if Hazezon Tamar entered the battlefield since the beginning of your last upkeep, put a 1/1 red, green, and white Sand Warrior creature token onto the battlefield for each land you control. Those creatures have "When a permanent named Hazezon Tamar isn\'t on the battlefield, exile this creature."', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, if an opponent controls more lands than you, you may search your library for up to three basic land cards, reveal them, and put them into your hand. If you do, shuffle your library.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, put a pin counter on Voodoo Doll.\\nAt the beginning of your end step, if Voodoo Doll is untapped, sacrifice it and it deals damage equal to the number of pin counters on it to you.\\n{X}{X}, {T}: Voodoo Doll deals X damage to target creature or player. X is the number of pin counters on Voodoo Doll.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, unless you pay {R}{R}{R}, an opponent gains control of Rohgahh of Kher Keep and all creatures you control named Kobolds of Kher Keep. If a player gains control of a creature this way, tap it.\\nCreatures you control named Kobolds of Kher Keep get +2/+2.', 'B', 'Cast Disharmony only during combat before blockers are declared.\\nUntap target attacking creature and remove it from combat. Gain control of that creature until end of turn.', 'Cast Eightfold Maze only during the declare attackers step and only if you are the defending player.\\nDestroy target attacking creature.', 'Cast Heavy Fog only during the declare attackers step and only if you are the defending player.\\nPrevent all damage that would be dealt to you this turn by attacking creatures.', "Cast Reset only during an opponent's turn after his or her upkeep step.\\nUntap all lands you control.", "Chain Lightning deals 3 damage to target creature or player. Then that player or that creature's controller may pay {R}{R}. If the player does, he or she may copy this spell and may choose a new target for that copy.", "Choose one — Destroy target blue permanent; or return target Island to its owner's hand.", "Choose one — Destroy target red permanent; or return target Mountain to its owner's hand.", 'Choose one — Target player gains X life; or prevent the next X damage that would be dealt to target creature or player this turn.', "Choose target creature. When that creature is put into a graveyard this turn, return a creature card from that graveyard to the battlefield under the control of that creature's owner.", 'Cinder Storm deals 7 damage to target creature or player.', 'Counter target creature spell.', 'Counter target spell unless its controller pays {1}.', "Counter target spell. At the beginning of your next main phase, add {X} to your mana pool, where X is that spell's converted mana cost.", "Creatures can't attack a player who didn't cast a spell and didn't put a card onto the battlefield during his or her last turn.", 'Creatures you control get +2/+0 until end of turn.', 'Creatures you control have horsemanship.', 'Crimson Kobolds is red.', "Defender (This creature can't attack.)\\nProtection from black", 'Destroy all black creatures.', 'Destroy all nonblack creatures. Hellfire deals X plus 3 damage to you, where X is the number of creatures put into all graveyards this way.', 'Destroy all tapped creatures.', 'Destroy target artifact or enchantment.', 'Destroy target creature with horsemanship.', 'Destroy target creature. Its owner gains 4 life.', 'Destroy target nonblack creature.', 'Destroy target permanent.', 'Discard X cards, then return a card from your graveyard to your hand for each card discarded this way. Exile Recall.', 'Divine Intervention enters the battlefield with two intervention counters on it.\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, remove an intervention counter from Divine Intervention. If there are no intervention counters on it, the game is a draw.', 'Draw a card for each tapped creature target opponent controls.', 'Draw three cards.', 'Each player sacrifices four lands. Burning of Xinye deals 4 damage to each creature.', 'Enchant creature\\nAt the beginning of the upkeep of enchanted creature\'s controller, put a -0/-1 counter on that creature.\\nWhen enchanted creature is put into a graveyard, that creature\'s controller chooses a creature that Takklemaggot could enchant. If he or she does, return Takklemaggot to the battlefield under your control attached to that creature. If he or she doesn\'t, return Takklemaggot to the battlefield under your control as a non-Aura enchantment. It loses "enchant creature" and gains "At the beginning of that player\'s upkeep, Takklemaggot deals 1 damage to him or her."', "Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature can't attack.\\nPrevent all combat damage that would be dealt by enchanted creature.", "Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +0/+2 and can't be the target of spells.", 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +2/-2.', 'Enchant creature\\nWhenever enchanted creature becomes tapped, put a -0/-2 counter on it.', 'Enchant land\\nEnchanted land is a Swamp.', "Except for creatures named Akron Legionnaire and artifact creatures, creatures you control can't attack.", "Exile All Hallow's Eve with two scream counters on it.\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, if All Hallow's Eve is exiled with a scream counter on it, remove a scream counter from it. If there are no more scream counters on it, put it into your graveyard and each player returns all creature cards from his or her graveyard to the battlefield.", 'Exile two target nonartifact creatures. Ashes to Ashes deals 5 damage to you.', 'Famine deals 3 damage to each creature and each player.', 'Fire Ambush deals 3 damage to target creature or player.', 'First strike', 'First strike, legendary landwalk', 'First strike\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, unless you pay {3}{B}{B}{B}, sacrifice Cosmic Horror and it deals 7 damage to you.', 'Flying', 'Flying, trample\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, sacrifice Palladia-Mors unless you pay {R}{G}{W}.', 'Flying\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, sacrifice Arcades Sabboth unless you pay {G}{W}{U}.\\nUntapped nonattacking creatures you control get +0/+2.\\n{W}: Arcades Sabboth gets +0/+1 until end of turn.', 'Flying\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, sacrifice Nicol Bolas unless you pay {U}{B}{R}.\\nWhenever Nicol Bolas deals damage to an opponent, that player discards his or her hand.', 'Flying\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, sacrifice Vaevictis Asmadi unless you pay {B}{R}{G}.\\n{B}: Vaevictis Asmadi gets +1/+0 until end of turn.\\n{R}: Vaevictis Asmadi gets +1/+0 until end of turn.\\n{G}: Vaevictis Asmadi gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', "Flying\\nIf Firestorm Phoenix would be put into a graveyard from the battlefield, return Firestorm Phoenix to its owner's hand instead. It can't be cast again until its owner's next turn.", 'Flying\\nOther Faerie creatures you control get +0/+1.\\n{T}: Other Faerie creatures you control get +1/+0 until end of turn.', 'Flying\\nRampage 2 (Whenever this creature becomes blocked, it gets +2/+2 until end of turn for each creature blocking it beyond the first.)\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, sacrifice Chromium unless you pay {W}{U}{B}.', 'Flying\\n{B}{R}{G}, {T}: Target player draws a card.', 'Flying\\n{G}, {T}: Add {R} to your mana pool.', 'Flying\\n{G}: Killer Bees gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Flying\\n{R}, {T}: Crimson Manticore deals 1 damage to target attacking or blocking creature.', 'Flying\\n{R}: Fire Drake gets +1/+0 until end of turn. Activate this ability only once each turn.', 'Flying\\n{R}{G}, {T}: Target creature gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Forked Lightning deals 4 damage divided as you choose among one, two, or three target creatures.', 'G', 'Haste', 'Horsemanship', 'Horsemanship, haste', 'Horsemanship, vigilance', 'Horsemanship\\nLiu Bei, Lord of Shu gets +2/+2 as long as you control a permanent named Guan Yu, Sainted Warrior or a permanent named Zhang Fei, Fierce Warrior.', 'Horsemanship\\nSacrifice Xiahou Dun, the One-Eyed: Return target black card from your graveyard to your hand. Activate this ability only during your turn, before attackers are declared.', 'Horsemanship\\nWhen Guan Yu is put into your graveyard from the battlefield, you may shuffle Guan Yu into your library.', "Horsemanship\\nWhen Sun Ce, Young Conquerer enters the battlefield, you may return target creature to its owner's hand.", 'Horsemanship\\nWhenever Lu Xun, Scholar General deals damage to an opponent, you may draw a card.', 'Horsemanship\\nWhenever Wei Night Raiders deals damage to an opponent, that player discards a card.', 'If an opponent who controls at least as many lands as you do would put a land onto the battlefield, that player instead puts that land onto the battlefield then sacrifices a land.', 'If target creature has toughness 5 or greater, it gets +4/-4 until end of turn. Otherwise, it gets +4/-X until end of turn, where X is its toughness minus 1.', "Jungle Lion can't block.", 'Kobold creatures you control have first strike.', 'Kobolds of Kher Keep is red.', "Legendary creatures don't untap during their controllers' untap steps.\\nWhen Arena of the Ancients enters the battlefield, tap all legendary creatures.", 'Look at the top three cards of your library. Put one of them into your hand and the rest into your graveyard.', 'Minotaur creatures get +1/+0.', 'Other Kobold creatures you control get +0/+1 and have trample.', 'Other Kobold creatures you control get +1/+0.', 'Other creatures you control get +1/+1.', 'Other green creatures you control get +1/+1.', "Prevent the next 1 damage that would be dealt to target creature or player this turn.\\nDraw a card at the beginning of the next turn's upkeep.", 'Protection from red\\nCreatures named Ivory Guardians get +1/+1 as long as an opponent controls a red permanent.', "Put target creature on top of its owner's library.", 'R', 'Rampage 1 (Whenever this creature becomes blocked, it gets +1/+1 until end of turn for each creature blocking it beyond the first.)', 'Rampage 2 (Whenever this creature becomes blocked, it gets +2/+2 until end of turn for each creature blocking it beyond the first.)', "Rasputin Dreamweaver enters the battlefield with seven dream counters on it.\\nRemove a dream counter from Rasputin: Add {1} to your mana pool.\\nRemove a dream counter from Rasputin: Prevent the next 1 damage that would be dealt to Rasputin this turn.\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, if Rasputin started the turn untapped, put a dream counter on it. Rasputin can't have more than seven dream counters on it.", 'Return target creature card from your graveyard to the battlefield.', "Return target permanent to its owner's hand.", 'Rolling Earthquake deals X damage to each creature without horsemanship and each player.', 'Sacrifice Loyal Retainers: Return target legendary creature card from your graveyard to the battlefield. Activate this ability only during your turn, before attackers are declared.', "Sacrifice a creature: You gain life equal to the sacrificed creature's toughness. Activate this ability only during your upkeep.", 'Search your library for a Forest card and put that card onto the battlefield. Then shuffle your library.', 'Search your library for a basic land card and put that card onto the battlefield. Then shuffle your library.', 'Search your library for a card and put that card into your hand, then shuffle your library. You lose 3 life.', 'Stolen Grain deals 5 damage to target opponent. You gain 5 life.', 'Sword of the Ages enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}, Exile Sword of the Ages and any number of creatures you control: Sword of the Ages deals X damage to target creature or player, where X is the total power of the creatures exiled this way.', 'Take an extra turn after this one.', "Target creature gains first strike until end of turn.\\nDraw a card at the beginning of the next turn's upkeep.", "Target creature gets +2/+0 until end of turn.\\nDraw a card at the beginning of the next turn's upkeep.", 'Target creature gets +2/+2 and gains horsemanship.', 'Target creature gets +3/+3 until end of turn.', 'Target player discards X cards at random.', "Tetsuo Umezawa can't be the target of Aura spells.\\n{U}{B}{B}{R}, {T}: Destroy target tapped or blocking creature.", 'Trample\\nWhenever a creature dealt damage by Axelrod Gunnarson this turn is put into a graveyard, you gain 1 life and Axelrod deals 1 damage to target player.', 'U', "Untap target artifact, creature, or land.\\nDraw a card at the beginning of the next turn's upkeep.", "Vigilance\\nBartel Runeaxe can't be the target of Aura spells.", 'W', 'When Corrupt Eunuchs enters the battlefield, it deals 2 damage to target creature.', "When Dance of Many enters the battlefield, put a token onto the battlefield that's a copy of target nontoken creature.\\nWhen Dance of Many leaves the battlefield, exile the creature token.\\nWhen the creature token leaves the battlefield, sacrifice Dance of Many.\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, sacrifice Dance of Many unless you pay {U}{U}.", 'When Dong Zhou, the Tyrant enters the battlefield, target creature an opponent controls deals damage equal to its power to that player.', 'When Shu Soldier-Farmers enters the battlefield, you gain 4 life.', 'When Stangg enters the battlefield, if Stangg is on the battlefield, put a legendary 3/4 red and green Human Warrior creature token named Stangg Twin onto the battlefield. When Stangg leaves the battlefield, exile the token. When that token leaves the battlefield, sacrifice Stangg.', 'When Zodiac Dragon is put into your graveyard from play, you may return it to your hand.', "When you cast Mana Vortex, you may sacrifice a land. If you don't, counter Mana Vortex.\\nAt the beginning of each player's upkeep, that player sacrifices a land.\\nWhen there are no lands on the battlefield, sacrifice Mana Vortex.", 'Whenever Hunting Cheetah deals damage to an opponent, you may search your library for a Forest card, reveal that card, put it into your hand, then shuffle your library.', 'Whenever Kjeldoran Frostbeast blocks or becomes blocked by a creature, destroy that creature at end of combat.', "Whenever Labyrinth Minotaur blocks a creature, that creature doesn't untap during its controller's next untap step.", 'Whenever Slashing Tiger becomes blocked, it gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', "Whenever a permanent becomes tapped, put a wind counter on it.\\nIf a permanent with a wind counter on it would untap during its controller's untap step, remove all wind counters from it instead.", 'Whenever a player plays a spell, counter it unless its controller pays {3}.', "Wu Warship can't attack unless defending player controls an Island.", 'You gain 2 life for each creature you control.', "You may choose not to untap Old Man of the Sea during your untap step.\\n{T}: Gain control of target creature with power less than or equal to Old Man of the Sea's power as long as Old Man of the Sea remains tapped and that creature's power remains less than or equal to Old Man of the Sea's power.", 'You may choose not to untap Rubinia Soulsinger during your untap step.\\n{T}: Gain control of target creature as long as you control Rubinia and Rubinia remains tapped.', 'You may choose not to untap Willow Satyr during your untap step.\\n{T}: Gain control of target legendary creature as long as you control Willow Satyr and Willow Satyr remains tapped.', "You may play an additional land during your turn if that land is a basic Forest.\\nSacrifice Gaea's Touch: Add {G}{G} to your mana pool.", "Young Wei Recruits can't block.", "{1}, {T}, Sacrifice Astrolabe: Add two mana of any one color to your mana pool. Draw a card at the beginning of the next turn's upkeep.", '{1}: Carrion Ants gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', '{1}{W}, {T}: Destroy target black creature.', '{2}, {T}: All creatures get -1/-0 until end of turn.', "{2}, {T}: Exile the top card of your library face down.\\n{0}: Sacrifice Knowledge Vault. If you do, discard your hand, then put all cards exiled with Knowledge Vault into their owner's hand.\\nWhen Knowledge Vault leaves the battlefield, put all cards exiled with Knowledge Vault into their owner's graveyard.", '{2}{B}{R}, {T}: Put a 1/1 black and red Demon creature token named Minor Demon onto the battlefield.', '{3}, Sacrifice Coal Golem: Add {R}{R}{R} to your mana pool.', "{3}, {T}: The next time a source of your choice would deal damage to you this turn, that damage is dealt to target creature of an opponent's choice instead.", "{3}: Target creature doesn't untap during its controller's next untap step.", '{3}: You may put a Minotaur permanent card from your hand onto the battlefield.', '{5}, Sacrifice Gauntlets of Chaos: Exchange control of target artifact, creature, or land an opponent controls and a permanent you control if they share one of those types. Destroy all Auras attached to those permanents.', "{B}: If Lesser Werewolf's power is 1 or more, it gets -1/-0 until end of turn and put a -0/-1 counter on target creature blocking or blocked by Lesser Werewolf. Activate this ability only during the declare blockers step.", '{B}{R}: Pavel Maliki gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', '{G}{G}, {T}: Tracker deals damage equal to its power to target creature. That creature deals damage equal to its power to Tracker.', '{G}{G}: Wormwood Treefolk gains forestwalk until end of turn and deals 2 damage to you.\\n{B}{B}: Wormwood Treefolk gains swampwalk until end of turn and deals 2 damage to you.', '{G}{W}{U}, {T}: Prevent all combat damage that would be dealt this turn.', '{G}{W}{U}, {T}: Regenerate target creature.', '{T}, Exile a creature you control: Put a storage counter on City of Shadows.\\n{T}: Add {X} to your mana pool, where X is the number of storage counters on City of Shadows.', '{T}, Untap a tapped land an opponent controls: Add one mana of any type that land could produce to your mana pool.', '{T}: Add to your mana pool one mana of any color that a land an opponent controls could produce.', '{T}: Add {2} to your mana pool.', '{T}: Add {B} to your mana pool.', '{T}: Add {B} to your mana pool. Elves of Deep Shadow deals 1 damage to you.', '{T}: Add {B} to your mana pool.\\n{T}: Target creature loses first strike or swampwalk until end of turn.', '{T}: Add {R} to your mana pool.\\n{T}: Target creature loses all landwalk abilities until end of turn.', '{T}: Add {U} to your mana pool.', "{T}: Add {W} to your mana pool.\\n{T}: Return target legendary creature to its owner's hand.", '{T}: Another target Minotaur creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', "{T}: Choose two target blocking creatures an opponent controls. If each of those creatures could block all creatures that the other is blocking, remove both of them from combat. Each one then blocks all creatures the other was blocking.\\nWhenever Sorrow's Path becomes tapped, it deals 2 damage to you and each creature you control.", "{T}: D'Avenant Archer deals 1 damage to target attacking or blocking creature.", '{T}: Destroy target enchanted creature.', '{T}: Draw two cards, then discard three cards.', '{T}: Lady Caleria deals 3 damage to target attacking or blocking creature.', '{T}: Prevent the next 2 damage that would be dealt to target creature this turn.', '{T}: Put target creature card from your graveyard on top of your library. Activate this ability only during your turn, before attackers are declared.', "{T}: Reveka, Wizard Savant deals 2 damage to target creature or player and doesn't untap during your next untap step.", '{T}: Target creature gets -1/-0 until end of turn.', '{T}: Target player discards a card at random. Activate this ability only during your turn.', '{T}: Tor Wauki deals 2 damage to target attacking or blocking creature.', '{T}: Wu Longbowman deals 1 damage to target creature or player. Activate this ability only during your turn, before attackers are declared.', '{T}: You may put a Faerie permanent card from your hand onto the battlefield.\\n{2}{G}: Target green creature gains protection from black until end of turn.', '{U}: Regenerate Spiny Starfish.\\nAt the beginning of the end step, if Spiny Starfish regenerated this turn, put a 0/1 blue Starfish creature token onto the battlefield for each time it regenerated this turn.', '{W}, Pay 1 life: Prevent the next 2 damage that would be dealt to target creature this turn.\\n{U}: Prevent the next 1 damage that would be dealt to target Cleric or Wizard creature this turn.\\n{B}, Put a -1/-1 counter on a creature you control: Prevent the next 2 damage that would be dealt to target player this turn.', '{W}{B}, {T}: Prevent all combat damage that would be dealt by target creature this turn.', '{X}, {T}: Banshee deals X damage divided evenly between you and target creature or player. Round up for you and down for that creature or player.', '{X}, {T}: Name a card. Target opponent reveals X cards at random from his or her hand. That player then discards all cards with that name revealed this way. Activate this ability only during your turn.', "{X}: You may put a creature card with converted mana cost X or less from your hand onto the battlefield face down as a 0/1 creature. Put X mask counters on that creature. Activate this ability only any time you could cast a sorcery. The creature's controller may turn the creature face up any time he or she could cast an instant by removing all mask counters from it. This effect ends if the creature is turned face up."]
